SUMMARY:TwitchAdBlock v31.7
DESCRIPTION:Twitch 31.7 | TwitchAdBlock 0.1.15\n\n**TwitchMods v0.1.15**\, 
 for Twitch iOS **31.7**\n\n### New: see what moderators delete\nTurn on **
 Keep Deleted Messages** in Settings → Emotes. When a moderator deletes a
  message\, or times out or bans someone\, their messages **stay in chat** 
 instead of disappearing\, and a short note like **"🛡 ronni was timed ou
 t for 10m"** shows up so you know what happened.\n- Want the notes to stan
 d out? Turn on **Highlight Notes**\, right under it\, to give them a highl
 ighted background.\n- Both are off by default. It only works for things th
 at happen while you're in chat.\n\n### New: hide the "From channels you fo
 llow" bar\nTurn on **Hide "From Channels You Follow"** in Settings → Hom
 e to remove the row of clips and recaps above the live channels on the Liv
 e page.\n\n### Fixed\n- The **"Go Ad-Free"** button on the Following tab i
 s hidden again. Twitch 31.7 rebuilt that tab\, so the old way of hiding it
  stopped working.\n\nEverything from v0.1.14 is still included: Twitch 31.
 7 support\, ad-blocking\, 7TV / BTTV / FFZ emotes (send them with the 7TV 
 bar or by holding the emote button)\, Keep Live Feed Playing\, Hide Storie
 s and your default launch screen.\n\n### Downloads\n- **`tv.twitch-31.7-Tw
 itchAdBlock-0.1.15.ipa`**: the full app.\n- **`tv.twitch-31.7-TwitchAdBloc
 k-0.1.15-noplugins.ipa`**: app extensions removed\, so a free Apple ID onl
 y uses 1 App ID slot when sideloading.\n\nUsing the AltStore / SideStore /
  Feather source? You'll get this update automatically:\n```\nhttps://raw.g
 ithubusercontent.com/gunnerkidBT/TwitchAdBlock/master/apps.json\n```\n\nFu
 ll plain-language changelog: [`CHANGELOG.md`](https://github.com/gunnerkid
 BT/TwitchAdBlock/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/twitchadblock.json
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
